Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:09.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.91,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[Canção tema de Mardin]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:17.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.86,0:03:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Se o cônjuge dado como morto reaparecer de alguma forma, o casamento atual é nulo de pleno direito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:21.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.94,0:03:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou seja, a união de vocês é considerada inválida desde o início.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:25.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.86,0:03:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês ouviram da boca do seu próprio advogado.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:35.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.54,0:03:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora vocês vão assinar este acordo e vão se divorciar imediatamente.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.94,0:04:03.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.06,0:04:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós já ouvimos o bastante de você.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.57,0:04:27.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.69,0:04:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dê-nos licença um momento.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:38.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.07,0:04:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente não tem noção da situação por acaso, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:46.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.62,0:04:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sabemos da nossa própria situação?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:49.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.48,0:04:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,E a senhora ainda manda o homem sentar ali.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:52.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.38,0:04:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ficou ouvindo toda a nossa conversa sem o menor pudor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.18,0:04:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que a senhora faz uma coisa dessas, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:55.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.55,0:04:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós já tínhamos conversado sobre isso com a Alya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:57.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós já conversamos sobre tudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:04:58.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.27,0:04:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós temos plena consciência da situação, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:00.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.77,0:05:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Se já sabia, então é ainda pior, Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:05.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sendo assim, por que continuou com isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:06.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.23,0:05:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não se divorciou dessa mulher?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:09.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.69,0:05:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabendo muito bem que esse casamento é inválido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.59,0:05:11.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.71,0:05:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Não teve vergonha de dormir na mesma cama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:13.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.47,0:05:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, que falta de respeito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:15.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.84,0:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tipo de conversa é essa? Tenha vergonha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:15.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.16,0:05:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vergonha do quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:18.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.88,0:05:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A vergonha é de vocês, não minha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.32,0:05:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran está vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.72,0:05:23.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.84,0:05:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lá embaixo... Sabendo muito bem que esse casamento é inválido,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:27.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.52,0:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,são vocês que continuam dormindo no mesmo quarto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:28.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.56,0:05:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Seus desavergonhados, imorais!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:32.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.88,0:05:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não fizemos nada de que nos envergonhar, Dona Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.78,0:05:35.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.90,0:05:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,E a senhora é a última pessoa no mundo para me dar lição de moral.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está me chamando de imoral?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:39.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.42,0:05:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não estou dizendo nada, a senhora mesma julgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.65,0:05:41.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.77,0:05:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem deixou a minha vida nesse estado?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:44.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.91,0:05:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem causou tudo isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:47.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.82,0:05:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Desde que pisei aqui, quem vivia dizendo: 'Você vai se casar com o Cihan'?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:52.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.36,0:05:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem mal casamos e já pedia um neto na frente de todo mundo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.44,0:05:56.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.56,0:05:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Antes de falar de moral, pare e pense nas coisas que a senhora fez!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:59.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.26,0:05:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Como eu ia adivinhar que você estaria tão ansiosa e aceitaria tão depressa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:01.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.98,0:06:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Não fui eu quem estava ansiosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:02.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.18,0:06:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabe quem estava ansioso?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:03.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.64,0:06:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:05.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.74,0:06:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele mandou um vídeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:08.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.48,0:06:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,E nele dizia ao Cihan: 'Irmão, case-se com a minha mulher!'
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.17,0:06:10.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.29,0:06:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Não fui eu quem estava ansiosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:15.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.00,0:06:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran mandou aquele vídeo porque achava que ia morrer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.52,0:06:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas agora ele está vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:19.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.81,0:06:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,E como eu ia saber?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:20.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.68,0:06:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Por acaso eu sabia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:21.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.98,0:06:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós sabíamos?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:22.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.78,0:06:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Como nós íamos adivinhar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:23.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.98,0:06:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele me disse alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.32,0:06:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,'Se eu sobreviver, me esconda', ele disse para um estranho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:27.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não disse à própria esposa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:30.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.36,0:06:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não confiou nela e não lhe contou nada?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:35.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.56,0:06:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vim parar aqui atrás do caixão de um homem que nem conhecia de verdade!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:38.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.56,0:06:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Faz um ano inteiro que estou derramando lágrimas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:40.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,E o que eu passei aqui por causa dele?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:42.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.96,0:06:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu filho sofreu tantos traumas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:44.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.99,0:06:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que ele não me contou nada?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:48.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.51,0:06:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu ia embora assim que cheguei aqui, mas vocês deixaram?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:50.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.93,0:06:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês me ameaçaram usando o meu filho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:52.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.65,0:06:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran não conhecia vocês?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:55.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.12,0:06:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran não sabia que vocês fariam isso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:07:00.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.47,0:07:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem vai pagar por tudo o que nós passamos esse tempo todo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabe quem vai pagar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:04.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.27,0:07:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A senhora!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:07.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.03,0:07:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não tenho que prestar contas a ninguém!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:10.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.95,0:07:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,E eu muito menos tenho contas a prestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:14.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.85,0:07:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem mais sofreu dores aqui fomos nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:16.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.41,0:07:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem levou o maior golpe fomos nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.51,0:07:17.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.63,0:07:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Fomos nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.19,0:07:19.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.31,0:07:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu filho junto comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:21.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.51,0:07:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,O Cihan junto comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:23.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.09,0:07:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não temos que prestar contas a ninguém!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.20,0:07:26.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.32,0:07:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha aqui, a realidade é esta...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:31.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.94,0:07:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A verdade é esta:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.34,0:07:35.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.46,0:07:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran está vivo, deitado lá embaixo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:37.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.27,0:07:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse casamento é inválido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.77,0:07:39.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.89,0:07:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês vão se divorciar imediatamente!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.61,0:07:40.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.73,0:07:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Há um testamento, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:44.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.92,0:07:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran me confiou a Alya, ele deixou um testamento!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:46.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.65,0:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran vai viver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:48.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.15,0:07:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai sobreviver!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:50.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.41,0:07:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas nós também queremos que ele viva, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:51.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.29,0:07:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai na real!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:53.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.17,0:07:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse é o único desejo de todo mundo aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.91,0:07:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas a situação dele é crítica, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:56.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.33,0:07:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Temos que esperar, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.75,0:07:58.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.87,0:07:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Temos que aguardar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:07:59.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.65,0:07:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu irmão tem razão.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:00.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.55,0:08:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,O que quer dizer 'o meu irmão tem razão'?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:01.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.59,0:08:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,O que quer dizer isso, hein?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:02.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.61,0:08:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,O desejo de vocês...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.53,0:08:04.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.65,0:08:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Então esse é o desejo de vocês?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:06.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.35,0:08:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês vão ficar esperando ele morrer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:08.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.89,0:08:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,É isso que vocês estão desejando!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:10.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.23,0:08:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Digam logo abertamente: é para continuarem juntos!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:12.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.91,0:08:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Estão torcendo para ele morrer, não é?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:17.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.51,0:08:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já não sei mais o que te dizer, francamente.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:20.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.60,0:08:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro por Deus, eu estou farto da senhora!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.07,0:08:25.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.19,0:08:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou farto de ver você machucar todo mundo aqui de propósito, com prazer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:33.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.97,0:08:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Enquanto todos vão para o quarto descansar, você fica aqui rondando para ver como conspirar pelas costas dos outros. Cansei disso!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.17,0:08:38.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.29,0:08:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, basta eu virar as costas para você prejudicar alguém!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:40.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.73,0:08:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dê um basta nisso de uma vez!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.70,0:08:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, eu cansei totalmente de você.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.04,0:08:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem dera você não fosse a minha mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:55.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.04,0:08:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha só o que você me fez dizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:04.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.92,0:09:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora decida você mesma se merece a minha bênção ou o meu desprezo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:08.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.48,0:09:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Enfileirou todas essas pessoas aqui na sala.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:14.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.57,0:09:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Achando que ia nos colocar em nossos lugares na frente de todos. Mãe, esqueça isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.18,0:09:16.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.30,0:09:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tire isso da sua cabeça!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:19.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.93,0:09:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou me divorciar, e a Alya também não.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:22.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.45,0:09:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não vamos nos divorciar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:26.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.56,0:09:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não vamos nos divorciar, Dona Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:31.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.42,0:09:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito bem, se é assim, eu mesma vou ao tribunal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:39.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.08,0:09:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Farei o que for preciso para anular esse casamento. Se vocês não se divorciarem, o juiz anula!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:41.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.67,0:09:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tribunal o quê, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:43.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.99,0:09:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai processar o meu irmão no tribunal? Ficou louca?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:46.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.33,0:09:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi só isso o que você conseguiu pensar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.09,0:09:48.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.21,0:09:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora me escute muito bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:50.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.54,0:09:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem está deitado lá embaixo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:51.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.66,0:09:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:52.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.33,0:09:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Com a identidade de quem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:54.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.48,0:09:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,De Ömer Bakır.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:56.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.07,0:09:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Aonde você vai recorrer no tribunal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:58.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.48,0:09:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai dizer: 'O Boran Albora está vivo'?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:10:01.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.83,0:10:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai expor o Boran, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.32,0:10:02.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.44,0:10:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,É claro que eu não vou expô-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:05.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.47,0:10:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran está aqui na mansão.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:06.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.63,0:10:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui o meu filho está seguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:08.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.97,0:10:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui ele está em segurança.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:10.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.29,0:10:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, agora preste muita atenção no que vou dizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.37,0:10:11.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.49,0:10:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Grave bem na sua cabeça.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:13.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.90,0:10:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai até o tribunal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.12,0:10:14.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.24,0:10:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai dizer: 'O Boran Albora está vivo'.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:16.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.59,0:10:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai entregar o seu próprio filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.32,0:10:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,E depois, quem virá?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.36,0:10:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Os homens do Süleyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:23.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.09,0:10:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadim, Demir...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:26.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.22,0:10:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem virá para terminar o serviço inacabado, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:27.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.20,0:10:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,O Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.41,0:10:30.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.53,0:10:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, você vive me dizendo:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.87,0:10:34.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.99,0:10:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,'Que o Boran viva, eu só penso no meu filho'.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.38,0:10:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,É no Boran que você está pensando de verdade?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:44.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.57,0:10:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,É, mãe, se você concorda com tudo isso, se vai ao tribunal expor o Boran só para nos separar, você pensa muito no seu filho mesmo, hein!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:46.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.48,0:10:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vá em frente.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.93,0:10:48.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.05,0:10:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Vá!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:51.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.42,0:10:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem mais alguma coisa a dizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:55.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.34,0:10:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não é o Ömer Bakır.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:10:59.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.63,0:10:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele é o Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:02.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.08,0:11:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran Albora, e está vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:03.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.16,0:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.59,0:11:08.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.71,0:11:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,E vocês, sabendo disso, vão continuar casados, é isso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:11.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.39,0:11:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, você vai se divorciar dessa mulher!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:13.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.58,0:11:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, o orgulho é um grande pecado.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:14.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.21,0:11:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Não faça isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:15.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.99,0:11:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Não caia em tentação.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.30,0:11:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Só para nos separar...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:19.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.99,0:11:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,não coloque a vida do Boran em risco.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:19.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.01,0:11:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:22.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.45,0:11:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,É isso o que você quer, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:25.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.70,0:11:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer mesmo que a gente assine isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:27.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.36,0:11:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso na verdade é expor o Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.64,0:11:30.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.76,0:11:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Na frente de todos aqui você diz:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:34.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.91,0:11:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,'Eu me importo com o Boran mais do que todos vocês'.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:37.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.83,0:11:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas o que você vai fazer só para nos separar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:37.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.94,0:11:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai até o tribunal,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:39.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.60,0:11:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,vai expor o Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.71,0:11:43.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.83,0:11:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer dizer então que eu amo o Boran mais do que você, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.63,0:11:44.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.75,0:11:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinto muito.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:46.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.41,0:11:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou me divorciar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.13,0:11:49.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.25,0:11:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Até o Boran se recuperar e se levantar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.39,0:11:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:53.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.23,0:11:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês não vão dizer nada, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:59.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.40,0:11:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vão abrir a boca diante dessa vergonha?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:02.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,O que se pode dizer para você, mãe? O que se pode dizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:06.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.13,0:12:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe só a situação. O quê, mãe? O que quer que a gente diga?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.76,0:12:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,O clima já está tenso, e você fica atacando as pessoas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:12.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, tudo só vai piorar. O que você quer afinal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:13.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.92,0:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você quer que a gente diga?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:15.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.14,0:12:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus faça com vocês o que merecem!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:20.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.98,0:12:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus dê a vocês o que merecem! Que vergonha de vocês!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:23.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.98,0:12:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que ninguém fique do meu lado, o Boran está comigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:27.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.96,0:12:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou ficar ao lado do meu filho. Eu vou mantê-lo vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:29.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.46,0:12:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse casamento vai acabar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:38.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.53,0:12:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, venha... coma isso, que te faça bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:41.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.77,0:13:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde foi parar o Cihan em um piscar de olhos?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:50.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,O rapazinho estava com vocês?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:51.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.20,0:13:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:55.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.58,0:13:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele estava no pátio agora há pouco e sumiu de repente.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:13:58.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.77,0:13:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:13:59.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.54,0:13:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.14,0:13:59.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.26,0:13:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.98,0:14:04.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.10,0:14:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha ali, veja ali... Onde estão a sua mãe e o seu pai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:07.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.70,0:14:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu deixei o leite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:08.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.35,0:14:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gostou muito, né, meu filho?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:12.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.74,0:14:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Coma isso, coma tudo e depois venha para cá, tá bom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.15,0:14:17.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.27,0:14:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu filho, olhe só, tem mais aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:21.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.82,0:14:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha só, eu não vou ficar esperando aqui, veja.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:26.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.70,0:14:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.81,0:14:30.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.93,0:14:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:33.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.17,0:14:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sr. Dursun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:36.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.56,0:14:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:48.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.52,0:14:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:56.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.66,0:14:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:58.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.57,0:14:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz.
