Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.54,0:15:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, eu trago o gatinho para você.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:13.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.00,0:15:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já venho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:14.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.74,0:15:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Pronto, tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:15.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.32,0:15:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.99,0:15:17.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
