Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha!
