Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.94,0:15:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Alya, a senhora precisa ver isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:22.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
