Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.27,0:15:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:30.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.24,0:15:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi? Pode falar de uma vez, o que está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:33.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.37,0:15:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fala.
