Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.33,0:17:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo, já avisei a ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:56.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.81,0:17:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu filho...
