Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.49,0:17:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...ficou assim porque ouviu a voz do filho!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:00.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.02,0:18:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu filho vai se levantar, vamos, meu amor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:02.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.52,0:18:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, acorde, meu querido.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:04.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.42,0:18:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha só, o seu filho está lá fora te esperando.
