Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.46,0:18:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estou aqui, bem do seu lado, meu amor... vamos, acorde.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:09.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.34,0:18:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, meu Boran... Chame o menino, Cihan, chame!
